+        <message name="IDS_CHROME_SIGNOUT_CONFIRMATION_PROMPT_DELETE_AND_SIGNOUT_BUTTON" desc="This string is found on a button that lets the user sign out of Redrob when the user taps it. It is on an error message dialog that appears when the user opens the Redrob Profile Menu and chooses 'Sign out of Redrob'. The error message appears when the user has saved some data (like a password or payment method) to Redrob, but Redrob wasn't able to save the data to the user's Google Account due to a network error; but, the data has been saved locally to Redrob. This text is a verb and is short for the longer phrase 'Delete data and sign out of Redrob anyway.'">
           Delete and sign out
